<!doctype html>
<html lang="es"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>JB GARAGE</title><style>body{font-family:Arial;background:#111;color:white;margin:0;padding:24px}main{max-width:500px;margin:auto}h1{color:#f44}input,button{box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;padding:15px;margin:8px 0;border-radius:8px;font-size:16px}input{background:#222;color:white;border:1px solid #555}button{background:#d22;color:white;border:0;font-weight:bold}section{background:#1c1c1c;padding:20px;border-radius:12px}small{color:#aaa}</style></head><body><main><h1>JB GARAGE</h1><p>Gestión de taller mecánico</p><section id="login"><h2>Acceso administrador</h2><form id="form"><input id="email" type="email" placeholder="Correo electrónico" required><input id="pass" type="password" placeholder="Contraseña" required><button>Entrar</button></form><p id="msg"></p></section><section id="panel" hidden><h2>Panel de control</h2><p id="user"></p><p>Conexión correcta. Los módulos de clientes, vehículos, órdenes, firmas y facturas se incorporarán en la siguiente versión.</p><button id="exit">Cerrar sesión</button></section><small>Versión inicial: prueba de acceso a Supabase.</small></main><script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@supabase/supabase-js@2"></script><script>const db=supabase.createClient('https://udzkofwobmbechzubgfy.supabase.co','sb_publishable_isb-Y6pov01tXKmL3mMVDQ_etfpxYn5');function show(s){document.getElementById('login').hidden=!!s;document.getElementById('panel').hidden=!s;if(s)document.getElementById('user').textContent=s.user.email}document.getElementById('form').onsubmit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();const {data,error}=await db.auth.signInWithPassword({email:document.getElementById('email').value,password:document.getElementById('pass').value});document.getElementById('msg').textContent=error?error.message:'';if(data?.session)show(data.session)};document.getElementById('exit').onclick=async()=>{await db.auth.signOut();show(null)};db.auth.getSession().then(({data})=>show(data.session));</script></body></html>
